          <Pad Id="DMy3iEDvndGrHy8EK2Htuy" Bounds="600,230,320,100" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&lt; Two Spread IOBoxes are a table: a column of names, a column of values. Attributes (Join) pairs them up and reads 28 as an integer, true as a boolean. The result is vvvv's own Dictionary, so Add, Remove, TryGetValue and ForEach all work on it.">
